# Shared by every HORUS SITL profile (see sim/scripts/world_profiles.py for the compositions).
# No fragment sets a key another fragment of the same load order sets; only the alternatives for
# one slot (indoor|outdoor) set the same keys, to different values.

# MAVLink-backed horizontal proximity sectors: the ToF bridge sends DISTANCE_SENSOR, and
# ArduPilot's simple avoidance brakes before obstacles instead of flying through them.
PRX1_TYPE 2
AVOID_ENABLE 3
# Stop 1 m from proximity obstacles (default 2 m), so the vehicle can still pass doorways and fly
# along the indoor room's walls; avoidance, not HORUS, keeps every world's obstacles away.
AVOID_MARGIN 1.0

# Downward ToF (payload range_down, 4 m range) from DISTANCE_SENSOR orientation PITCH_270 as a
# short-range landing/altitude input.
RNGFND1_TYPE 10
RNGFND1_ORIENT 25
# Copter 4.7 MIN/MAX are in metres; the old centimetre-named parameters no longer exist.
RNGFND1_MIN 0.05
RNGFND1_MAX 4.0

# The gazebo-iris SITL defaults enable ArduPilot precision landing (PLND_ENABLED 1, PLND_TYPE 3,
# a Gazebo IR-lock beacon) that nothing here feeds. With no target ever seen, every LAND and RTL
# touchdown starts with "PrecLand: Failsafe Measures" and hovers 7 s before descending. HORUS
# runs its own AprilTag precision landing in GUIDED and hands touchdown to plain LAND.
PLND_ENABLED 0

# Simulated battery that never runs out (decided 2026-11-02): SITL's default 3.3 Ah pack drains
# to 0 % in a few hours of hovering. 100,000 Ah lasts thousands of hours; the percentage stays
# near 100 and no battery failsafe is configured.
BATT_CAPACITY 100000000
